  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Arab Science &amp; Engineering Education Support Program (ICDL Funds)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity promotes the popularization of sciences amongst school students, raises their skills in scientific research and influences the innovation policy development at the national level, while injecting new knowledge into the current science curricula in a cost-effective and practical manner in order to equip new college graduates with the necessary and required current market skills. Target Audience &amp; Beneficiaries of this project are school science teachers, students &amp; their parents, science lovers, innovative kids and developers with a particular focus on the female population;</narrative>
  </description>
